WEBVTT

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:03.560
Yes.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.680
You too, Papa. Take care so you don't catch a summer cold.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:11.560
Thanks for calling even though you're busy.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.460
You'll miss your train if you don't leave soon.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:16.820
Oh, no!

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.150
Here's your lunch.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.900
I packed a lot of kinpira-style burdock.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.500
Thanks! Well then, Papa, I'm hanging up.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.200
Yes! I love you, Papa!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.700
See you later!

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.850
It's July, so I'm wearing my summer uniform.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.160
I got to talk to Papa before leaving,

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.160
my lunch has lots of kinpira burdock in it,

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:12.570
the train's horoscope said I'm very lucky today,

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.330
and the sun feels good too.

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.890
Good morning,

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:17.140
Tamatama-chan!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.520
Good morning!

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.870
Eh? Why are you here?

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.870
Why did I high-five you so naturally?

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:30.170
Ah, I'm so glad you remember me!

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.660
Erm, Teru-san, was it?

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:35.540
Correct! How's everyone in your club?

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.410
Club?

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.710
Some Dead Fish Eyes, Not Enough Sunlight, Shuttle Run Club.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:44.310
I said it in one breath!

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:46.280
I did it, Shiina!

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:51.900
This club was the previous president's, Teru-senpai's, idea.

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:55.280
Ah, I see! Teru-senpai is Teru-san!

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:57.590
Oh? I didn't tell you?

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:00.300
They did say you were in college...

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:06.290
Your summer uniform looked so fresh that I turned into school-uniform Teru-san again.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:11.220
I played that game the SNS Club just released, Tamatama-kun.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.300
Eh, really?

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:17.280
If I look back at the pictures I drew, there are many parts that I feel embarrassed about.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:22.780
This friend of mine, Ha-chan, is so good, too. I have to do my best.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:26.000
I see. Are you going to be in Summer Comiket?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.300
Y-yes. We're adapting one of Seki-senpai's old stories.

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:35.510
But my part is progressing slowly...

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:39.060
Then how about you change your hairstyle for a change of pace?

00:03:39.060 --> 00:03:40.280
Eh? When did you-

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:46.220
I'm going to sneak into school and loiter about.

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.540
Wait! Wait, wait!

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.080
My hair gets messy if I don't hold it down.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.020
Is that so? Never mind, never mind!

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:58.620
It's embarrassing. Maybe I should wear a hairband like Teru-san.

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.740
A normal one, without cat ears.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.160
This isn't a cat-eared headband.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:04.580
A real one?!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.800
I'll go for a stroll around here during class.

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.520
What an odd person...

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.600
Hm? That hair...

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.520
Seki-senpai.

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.220
What's the matter?

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.860
Ah, it's nothing.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.560
Did you change your image, Honda-san?

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:26.720
Your hair's pretty.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.210
Hey, isn't that...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.250
She looks different, but she's pretty!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.660
Is that a first-year?

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:38.860
Probably higher.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:41.860
What should I do? It's embarrassing.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:46.220
It's embarrassing, but somehow it feels so good!

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.200
I wonder if my senpai are in the cafeteria...

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:51.260
Oh,

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.060
it's Ha-chan.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.800
What's that, did you change your image?

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.150
We had tests the other day,

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:01.420
but you failed because you were drawing instead of studying,

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.900
so you resolved that you had to change your attitude.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:04.680
Is that it?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.810
You're right about the first half.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.680
I knew it had to be something like that.

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:16.330
If Honda Tamaki is drawing right now, this is no time for be to be studying.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:23.180
Murakami-senpai is teaching us about the novel's engine. What do we do about the illustrations?

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:24.740
Illustrations...

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:28.650
If I had to say, drawing old men is your specialty.

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.660
Will I be okay?

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:35.670
Since you're so good, Ha-chan, perhaps you should draw...

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:38.320
Is that all the passion you have for drawing old men?

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:40.660
If you want to get better,

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:44.300
draw something so dumbfoundingly ardent that it'll leave me speechless!

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.100
Ahll do my best!

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.740
Wai- I didn't say that right now!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:54.650
I'm a secret admirer of the SNS Club who just walked by.

00:05:54.650 --> 00:05:56.710
First year student, Teru. Nice to meet you.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.820
Same as me, then. Nice to meet you.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.460
You mean first year of college, right, Teru-san?

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:05.530
This girl here, for someone who's drawing pictures to go with Iris-sensei's scenario,

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.680
she doesn't have enough pride, so I was trying to encourage her.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.640
That's not-

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.410
I see...

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:16.600
In order for her to portray Ayachi's sense accurately,

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:21.180
she needs to build up a thorough view of the world.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:29.100
But in order to do that, her perception must be in sync with the story.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.360
I think we can get along.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.580
I feel like I'm being badmouthed.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:38.160
I have to leave now.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:40.540
I'm looking forward to your new work.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:43.450
Aren't you going to meet the others?

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:48.180
It's embarrassing, so I'll pass. Send my regards to Shiinan and the rest.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.500
She really came just to play around.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:54.550
Is "Shiinan" Murakami-senpai?

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:58.660
Isn't it rude for a first year to speak of the SNS Club president like that?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:04.440
Even if you're not a club member, you should address your senpai with respect.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:08.880
I think Ha-chan's even ruder than that to Seki-senpai, though.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:12.120
It seems my kouhais are giving their best.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:18.210
I don't need to meet Shiinan to know that she's keeping our promise.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:26.420
Um, Honda-san, can I have that computer for a moment? I want to retrieve some old files.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.190
Of course! Sorry for borrowing it all the time.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:33.600
Can't you make them more expressive? They're too bland.

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.710
I'm trying my best! I got some advice from Seki-senpai earlier too.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.860
Ahh, that glasses girl?

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:43.530
Well, it's important to have a non-creative person's opinion.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:46.680
She's so hard on Seki-senpai.

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:51.760
That computer has really high specs, so learn to use it well.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:56.280
It's a model from a few years ago, and I have another laptop for myself.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:57.860
By the way,

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:01.860
is it okay for you to hang around here when you're not a member yet?

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.800
Today's an exception!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.700
Sorry for the wait.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.080
Ah, Iris-sensei!

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:09.930
Her makeup smells so strong.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:11.590
Aya's unexpectedly into it.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:16.100
Thank you for your message. You told me you'd be coming, just as promised.

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:20.040
Yes! Since Sensei insisted that I do so.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.260
She needs to disguise herself as Iris-sensei, after all.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.480
She got a message earlier and left in a hurry.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.800
I was so nervous today, thinking I'd get to meet you.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:33.670
I re-drew all the faces in my history textbook as yours.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:35.660
All of them, huh?

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.180
Do you want some sweets, Honda-san?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:41.120
We have mochi.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:41.660
Um!

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.640
Can I use this computer?

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:49.090
Go ahead. I grabbed the files I needed.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:54.260
Oh, the folder the president opened earlier is still open.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:02.100
Alt+F4 Alt+F4 Alt+F4 Alt+F4

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.680
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:06.480
How do you usually think up your stories, Sensei?

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.680
With my daily feelings of yearning, I suppose.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:13.340
I take my various meetings and partings,

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:19.300
and the uproars and wonders that fill my daily life and weave them into words. That's all.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.400
Wonderful...

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:27.290
I read your other works from your days in the Literature Club. I was deeply moved!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.150
I-I'm happy to hear that.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.380
Why did you quit the Literature Club?

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:35.510
I felt it was going to become stale.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:40.540
In the all-too-peaceful Literature Club, I would spiral down into monotony-

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:43.000
But you said your life was filled with uproar...

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:48.220
I meant I was so used to the Literature Club's uproar it was the same as nothing to me.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.310
Oh, I see!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.350
It's a total mess.

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:53.400
She's bothering Seki-senpai.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.900
I'd say she's enjoying it.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:10:00.330
Isn't it a bit weird to be so clingy? They're not lovers.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.500
This book is so fresh!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.500
I took some risks with that one.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.420
As a creator, you have to broaden your horizon.

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:11.370
So your personal experiences, like the people you meet, are very important?

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:14.570
Speaking of which, how do you get along with that senpai with the glasses?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.720
Eh? H-h-how...?

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:20.980
These glasses...

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:22.960
I see!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:25.830
You discipline her harshly!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:27.420
Why doesn't she figure it out?!

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.740
Ha-chan, you're digressing!

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:33.080
You had something to consult with Seki- Iris-senpai about.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:34.360
That's right.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.930
I can't think of a composition for this scene's illustration.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.700
Could you draw me a rough reference picture?

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:47.030
Hey, Aya! You put a drawing of yours as the website's background without asking!

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:49.030
What's this frightful picture?

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:49.850
It's Fujikawa-san.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:50.920
What part of it?

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.970
W-well, if it's just drawing, it should be no problem...

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:59.460
Wait! Sensei already prepared a rough picture for that scene.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.680
Already!

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:06.090
Ah, that's the wrong one! This is a picture of Iris-sensei disciplining the glasses girl!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:08.890
Just when did you make that?

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:17.060
It's already this late... I'm sorry, Iris-sensei, I got absorbed in our talk.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:20.620
It's fine, it's fine. Thanks for today.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:23.940
It's me who's very thankful for today!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.940
These mochi really cling to your hands, right, President?

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:35.440
Yes, they're very sticky.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:40.330
I-I've been to a doujin market with Iris-san, you know.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:45.350
So what? You're nowhere near as zealous about Sensei's work as I am.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.270
Between me and Ha-chan, who is better at drawing, Senpai?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:51.230
E-ehhh?

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:54.630
That's obviously me. Right, Sensei?

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:55.920
Which one do you like better?

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.260
It's me, right?

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.820
I just got here, but is that...

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:01.740
a lovers' dispute?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:03.740
Soap operas don't air this late.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.960
It's a two-hour special.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:13.990
She finally left...

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:17.420
I'm so tired. I got carried away competing with her.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.200
Honda-san.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:23.400
I said it before, but I don't think it's good to compete over your qualities.

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:25.930
You have your own style.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.940
We all have our own characteristics, but I want to get good on top of that.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:33.620
Do you think it doesn't matter who's drawing?

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:38.570
I want to draw better than I did for our last game. Is that wrong?

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.320
Ah, you made her cry.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.080
Sorry, Honda-san. Pay no mind to this.

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:48.820
Ah! Um...

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.120
I-I'm leaving for today!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.210
Ah. Wait, Honda-san!

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:55.380
Excuse me!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.480
I took it out on the president.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.540
I guess I'm really frustrated over this.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:09.980
I have to cool myself down.

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.500
It was my fault, right?

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.740
I dropped the president's computer!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.240
I-is it okay?

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.860
The screen's completely black!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.420
I-it's just in standby, right?

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.340
But wait, one of the lights is on.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.920
I-I broke it!

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:42.960
Oh dear.

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.720
Looks like you broke it, Tamatama-chan.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:46.820
Teru-san...

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:49.140
Wh-what should I do?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.600
There's nothing you can do but apologize to Shiinan.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:58.230
Can you come with me? I yelled at the president earlier.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:18.420
It's mine.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:38.580
Keep it together, President.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:47.120
I get the feeling I'm being followed.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.380
How should I apologize...

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.770
I couldn't talk it out with Honda-san properly back there.

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:08.920
Today's not my day. I'll just go home and study for-

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:14.060
President!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.180
I'm home, Mom.

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:20.440
Welcome back, Shiina. You brought a friend?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.760
Yes, she's a kouhai from my club.

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:26.840
This is my mom. She's a programmer and she mostly works from home.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:29.280
I'm Honda Tamaki, pleased to meet you.

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:34.820
Pleased to meet you. Shiina only brings female friends home...

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.230
Are there no rumors about her and some boy?

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:40.120
Of course there aren't. I'm not interested in that.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:43.020
I'll be working inside, make yourself at home.

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.240
Stay for the night if you'd like!

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.640
Thanks, but I won't be that long.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:50.820
Ah, I have no problem if it's with another girl, either.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.040
When they were small, she told Ayame-chan that they'd get marri-

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:55.640
Just go back to work!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.720
I swear, mom...

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:03.740
If it's your mother's wish, I'll do anything.

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:07.500
I did something that I need you to forgive me for, no matter what!

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.950
No, no, you don't have to do anything.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.670
So, what do you want me to forgive?

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:18.560
You see...

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:22.480
Was that too harsh a way to put it?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:27.520
Erm, I'm sorry about that thing in the clubroom. I lost my composure.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.740
No, it wasn't your fault.

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:33.000
It's me who's sorry, I lashed out at you.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.260
This is awkward.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:40.780
W-well...

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:44.920
W-what bad timing, right?

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.480
Right...

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.120
Hi!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.770
Seki-senpai.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.640
Hm? Honda-san, what happened?

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:54.360
That's what I should ask you. What's with that look?

00:16:54.640 --> 00:16:58.160
You see, my youngest brother starts crying when he sees me like this.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:01.830
I don't have make-up cleaner at home, so I thought I'd borrow yours.

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:05.790
By the way, Honda-san, why are you here?

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:08.250
I-I had something to talk about with the president.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:11.760
I see. You did sort of have a fight back there.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.800
I understand that you tend to get heated up in from of Ha-chan,

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.880
but our president here has always been too timid too.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:22.900
It'd be more fitting of her role if she were more assertive with her kouhais.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.820
If you keep bringing up the past, I'll stop removing your make-up.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.160
Whoa, gross!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:29.610
So asymmetric!

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.180
I'll do it myself! I'm borrowing your bathroom!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.950
Ah, Seki-senpai-

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:39.830
Um...

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:40.960
P-president!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:50.500
I-I'm sorry! I broke it!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:56.800
You broke it? My laptop, you mean?

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:59.040
I dropped it after I left the clubroom.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:03.810
It's a very good computer, and you have important files on it, right?

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:06.080
Not really, I have a backup.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:08.580
Huh?

00:18:09.590 --> 00:18:11.700
It had just run out of battery.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.540
I'm so glad...

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:20.540
You worry too much.

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:24.360
Oh, I'm sorry, it seems my strength has left me.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:29.420
A-are you alright? Do your legs hurt or something?

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.140
You worry too much.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.380
I wish I had an older sister like you.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:36.020
Eh?

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.920
You're so level-headed, President.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:40.200
And cute too.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:41.440
No.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:45.100
I'm too pessimistic and lack confidence.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.770
And I'm not cute...

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:50.900
Not at all. You're kind and look after your kouhais.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.730
You always give it your best. I think you're wonderful.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.540
Good evening!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:06.910
Honda Tamaki, what are you doing here?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.360
What about you, Ha-chan?

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:13.830
Murakami-senpai's been teaching me how to write a game script for the past few days.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.060
The president?

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.240
But it may have been fate to meet you here.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.520
Honda Tamaki, there's something I want us to do.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.000
Eh?

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:26.600
We're going to make some serious progress on the game we're making.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.740
Now?

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:31.690
End-of-term test are coming up, and I'll find it hard to make time for it.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.140
So let's do as much as we can while we can.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:38.310
W-what's this all of a sudden? I have some drawings that I need to spend time coloring.

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.900
Do that now.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.360
I'll lend you my spare graphics tablet.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:45.410
See if you can impress me with your results.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:49.400
Don't think of it as a contest, think of our schedule too.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.180
You say something too, Aya.

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:55.860
To think I'd meet you again! This too may be fate.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:57.500
Why did you put the make-up back on?

00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.780
Ah, Iris-sensei!

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:02.250
Alright, I'm not going to lose!

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.550
Don't forget what I taught you the other day.

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.760
Really now, don't think of it as a contest...

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:11.080
What's all the fuss about? Don't go making too much of a ruckus just because you're young.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.780
Mom, sorry about doing this in the middle of the night.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:18.920
Just before a release, you have to collect yourself to make it through.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:22.590
Drinks and food are taken care of, so work to your hearts' content!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:27.320
I'll bring out some sleeping bags. Feel free to use the bath too.

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:28.920
Thank you very much!

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:34.180
Hang on a moment! You're all assuming we're having an overnighter, but this is my room!

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:45.460
Well, I'm mostly done teaching Ha-chan about game scripts anyway.

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:51.040
As long as we make it for Summer Comiket, there's nothing wrong with some hard training.

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:56.230
The next club president is... first year, class three, Murakami Shiina!

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.400
B-but, I...

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.410
Can Shii really lead other members?

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:07.900
Shiinan is considerate of others and she's good at looking at the big picture.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:12.980
Keep the SNS Club lively from now on. About ten times as lively.

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:14.760
That bar's too high!

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:17.740
It's a promise.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:18.600
A promise?

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:27.770
President, can you come take a look at this motion?

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.340
Ah. Yes, I'm coming.

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:48.600
Ten times... is it about this much?

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:24.060
Nee-san.

00:23:24.060 --> 00:23:25.500
You!

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:26.900
I can't accept that.

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:30.260
It's because we do that we can take pride in our life.

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:32.720
See, you found it. The reason why you draw.
